<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Kinder Morgan said started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kinder Morgan said started as buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities on Friday started Kinder Morgan Energy Partners LP with a buy rating, according to a source at the brokerage.</p>
<p>-- No further details were immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed at 57-1/4 on Thursday.</p>
</text>
